  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Location",
   "texto": [
    "**Di** presents the place where something or someone is: **di rumah** (at home), **di Jakarta** (in Jakarta). To name a location, the normal order is place + adjective: **kota besar** = large city. No word equivalent to «es» is added in simple phrases like **Jakarta kota besar**."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Close and far",
   "texto": [
    "**Dekat** means «close» and **jauh**, «far away». You can say **jauh dari universitas**: «away from college». The word **di** is separated from the name of the place."
   ]
  },
